name: Gemini 检测验证
desc: |-
    - 临时调试：验证 Gemini 解锁检测 SendRequest 失败是否与响应头过大有关
category: debug
icon: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/qsoyq/shell/main/assets/icon/debug.png
tiles:
    -   name: gemini-check
        backgroundColor: '#178BD8'
        interval: 1800
        title: Gemini 验证
        content: 加载中
script-providers:
    gemini-check:
        url: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/qsoyq/stash/analyze-gemini-media-unlock-checker-failure/script/debug/gemini-check.js
        interval: 86400
